---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const demoUrl = 'https://demo.poesis.cloud';
---
<BaseLayout title="Poesis">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="motto">Define the world in software; generate it.</p>
      <h1>Harnessing generative AI for an age of governed synthetic autopoiesis.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Poesis makes synthetic autopoiesis governable: systems continuously regenerate their organization through generative AI while remaining grounded in explicit definitions, systemic governance, and human oversight.</p>
      <p class="lead">Poesis closes the IT <strong>THINK → BUILD → RUN</strong> loop — <strong>systematically and autonomously, with humans in the loop.</strong>
      <p class="lead">Today, IT's Think — governance and specifications — live in prose — architecture wiki, compliance spreadsheets, review boards — that drifts from reality the moment it is written. Poesis stack turns that prose into governed, typed, versioned, <strong>machine-operable</strong> <i>definitions</i> it can act on, generate from, and continuously enforce.</p>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href={demoUrl}>Try now</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#portfolio">Explore the portfolio</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/contact">Talk to us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="portfolio" class="section section--soft">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <p class="eyebrow">Portfolio</p>
        <h2>An open systemic model standard, an engine implementing it, domain applications on top of it — and the agentic AI generating from that.</h2>
        <p class="lead">GSM roots the <i>definitions</i> (governance intents and specifications) into systemics field; SIE operates the <i>definitions</i>; ITIP applies that to IT; the SAFe Agentic generates <i>definitions</i> and operational artifacts from <i>definitions</i>; and Poesis services deliver the change. Each piece links to the other to close the IT Think-Build-Run loop, <strong>systematically and autonomously</strong>, <strong>with humans in the loop.</strong></p>
      </div>

      <div class="arch" aria-label="Poesis stack — functional architecture map">
        <div class="arch-legend" aria-hidden="true">
          <span>poesis stack · functional architecture</span>
          <span>every block is clickable</span>
        </div>

        <div class="arch-grid">
          <div class="arch-stack">
            <article class="arch-scope">
              <div class="arch-scope-meta">
                <span class="tag tag--muted">Application</span>
                <span class="arch-zone">THINK · apply</span>
              </div>
              <h3><a href="/itip">ITIP</a></h3>
              <p>The IT Intelligence Platform — govern and define the IT landscape as a single source of truth, and generate IT artifacts.</p>
              <nav class="arch-comps" aria-label="ITIP components">
                <a class="arch-comp" href="/itip#definition">Definition</a>
                <a class="arch-comp" href="/itip#truth-sourcing">Truth sourcing</a>
                <a class="arch-comp" href="/itip#frameworks">Frameworks</a>
                <a class="arch-comp" href="/itip#artifactory">Artifactory</a>
              </nav>
            </article>

            <div class="arch-joint" aria-hidden="true"><span>built on · powered by</span></div>

            <article class="arch-scope">
              <div class="arch-scope-meta">
                <span class="tag tag--muted">Engine</span>
                <span class="arch-zone">THINK · operate</span>
              </div>
              <h3><a href="/sie">SIE</a></h3>
              <p>The Systemic Intelligence Engine — implements GSM, operates the <i>definitions</i>, enforces their lifecycle, and powers every domain application above it.</p>
              <nav class="arch-comps" aria-label="SIE components">
                <a class="arch-comp" href="/sie#definition-manager">Definition Manager</a>
                <a class="arch-comp" href="/sie#operator">Operator</a>
                <a class="arch-comp" href="/sie#blackboard">Blackboard</a>
              </nav>
            </article>

            <div class="arch-joint" aria-hidden="true"><span>implements</span></div>

            <article class="arch-scope arch-scope--standard">
              <div class="arch-scope-meta">
                <span class="tag">Standard</span>
                <span class="arch-zone">THINK · define</span>
              </div>
              <h3><a href="/gsm">GSM</a></h3>
              <p>The Generative System Model — the vendor-neutral standard for defining and governing systems. Publicly readable, the top of every funnel.</p>
              <nav class="arch-comps" aria-label="GSM components">
                <a class="arch-comp" href="/gsm#primitives">Eight primitives</a>
                <a class="arch-comp" href="/gsm#grammar">DNA grammar</a>
                <a class="arch-comp" href="/gsm#archetypes">Archetypes</a>
                <a class="arch-comp" href="/gsm#interop">Lifecycle &amp; conformance</a>
              </nav>
            </article>
          </div>

          <div class="arch-bridge" aria-hidden="true"><span>definitions ⇄ build artifacts</span></div>

          <aside class="arch-side">
            <article class="arch-scope arch-scope--framework">
              <div class="arch-scope-meta">
                <span class="tag tag--muted">Framework + Portfolio</span>
                <span class="arch-zone">BUILD · generate</span>
              </div>
              <h3><a href="/framework">SAFe Agentic</a></h3>
              <p>The open (Apache-2.0) BUILD layer — a portfolio-to-iteration orchestration of AI agents that turns prose or <i>definitions</i> into Build artifacts, an analytical, auditable, and reviewable way.</p>
              <nav class="arch-comps" aria-label="SAFe Agentic components">
                <a class="arch-comp" href="/framework#orchestration">Orchestration</a>
                <a class="arch-comp" href="/framework#bench">Specialist bench</a>
                <a class="arch-comp" href="/framework#harness">Deterministic harness</a>
                <a class="arch-comp" href="/framework#local-first">Local-first</a>
                <a class="arch-comp" href="/framework#portable">Portable</a>
              </nav>
            </article>
          </aside>
        </div>

        <div class="arch-joint" aria-hidden="true"><span>enforces · observes</span></div>

        <div class="arch-run">
          <span class="arch-zone arch-zone--run">RUN</span>
          <p>Your IT landscape — deployed from generated artifacts, enforced by the Operator, observed back as evidence into the definitions.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container center">
      <h2>Bring the whole stack to your organization.</h2>
      <p class="lead" style="margin-inline:auto">AI-generative, agentic transformation — IT first — delivered with the Poesis stack as the governed substrate of your change.</p>
      <p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/services">How we engage →</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--ink">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Our first custody</p>
      <h2>Poesis runs on Poesis.</h2>
      <p class="lead">We are our own first customer. The Poesis stack that will integrate your systems already define, build, and govern ours — Poesis's development power rests on the very stack it ships.</p>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href={demoUrl}>Try the ITIP demo</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://github.com/poesis-cloud" style="background:transparent;color:#fff;border-color:#334155">See it on GitHub</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
